<div class="settings-field"><label for="slug">Slug *</label><input id="slug" name="slug" required maxlength="120" pattern="[a-z0-9]+(-[a-z0-9]+)*" value="<%= values.slug||'' %>"><p class="field-hint">Automatically filled from the English <%= module.program?'title':'name' %>. You can override it; clearing it resumes suggestions on the next name change. Shared EN/NE address. Retain saved slugs after sharing links.</p></div>
